  digest=b3:65a3e18ce7ac3e531147a1a2b4291b83667d028c50b31a09a53f3150f541cec9 file=neo/internal/automatrixsettings/automatrixsettings.go range=67:81 lang=go exported=true byte_range=3041:3485
  sig=func Open(dir string) *Store
  doc=Open builds a store rooted at dir and loads any persisted state. An empty dir\nyields an in-memory-only store (a safe, durable-less fallback) so dev/CLI\nruns and tests still toggle the opt-in correctly.
EDGES
  ^defines=matrix/neo/internal/automatrixsettings/automatrixsettings.go

