  sig=func (s *Store) SetEnabled(enabled bool, alarmID string) error
  doc=SetEnabled records the opt-in flag and the alarm id together (one atomic\nmutation), so the live setting and the alarm bookkeeping never diverge.\nDisabling clears the alarm id. Persists immediately when durable.
